{
  "id": "MAT.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 2",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abageni korwa moocha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso nigo aiboretwe ase omochie o Bethlehemu ime ya Boyahudi, ase amatuko aria Herode arenge omorwoti. Matuko make igo nyuma kaiboirwe, abaringoria b’eching’enang’eni bagacha korwa moocha goika Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bakaboria “Ng’ai are omwana oiborwe oyio orabe omorwoti bw’Abayahudi? Nigo twaroche eng’enang’eni yaye ekero yachete agwo igoro ime ya moocha, naende intwe nigo twachire komosasiima.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omorwoti Herode achia koigwa aya ere agaichana mono, nabo igo kera omonto ime ya Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akabarangeria amo abakuani abanene bonsi amo n’aborokia b’amachiiko akababoria, “Narai gose Kristo araiborerwe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakairaneria. Ase omochie o Bethlehemu ime ya Boyahudi, ekiagera aya naro omobani ariigete:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "’Bethlehemu ase ense ya Yuda,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ase enchera ende yonsi aye tori moke ase egati y’emechie emenene ya Yuda;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ekiagera korwa ime yao nache omorai oyio orarae abanto baane ba Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Herode akarangeria abageni baria barwete moocha agatwara okoumerana kwa bobisi nabarabwo, erio akamanya korwa ase bare kegima chingaki eng’enang’eni eria yarorekanete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabatoma goika Bethlehemu, n’amang’ana akobwatia: “Genda morigie buya omwana oyio, ekero moramonyore ere, nainche momanyie, erio nainche boigo ingende komosasiima ere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo barabwo bakarwa aroro, kobare nchera kogenda bakarora naende eng’enang’eni eria eria baroche ase ensemo ya moocha. Ekero barabwo bayeroche omogoko obo okabucha, inaki omogoko obo obete omonge! Ekabatang’ana, goika egatenena igoro aase omwana oria arenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakagenda bagasoa nyomba, bakarora omwana amo na Mariamu ng’ina, bagatung’ama inse, bakamosasiima. Erio bagakuunora chinibo chiabo, bakamokwaneria ebinto ebiya, etaabu, na ubani, na manemane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bakairana gochia soobo bakabwatia enchera eng’ao ekiagera Nyasae konya obakuureire ase chindoto nga tibairanera ase Herode.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogotamigwa kw’Omwana gochia Misiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega k’abageni baria bachiire, omomalaika bw’Omonene akaorokera Yusufu ase chindoto, akamoteebia, “Imoka korwa aa, oire omwana na ng’ina, otame gochia Misiri, omenye aroro goika ngoteebie, ekiagera Herode narigie omwana oyo anyare komoita.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akaimoka botuko, akaira omwana oria na ng’ina, akagenda Misiri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamenya aroro goika Herode agakwa, erinde rinyare goikerana eriateebetwe n’Omonene ase omonwa bw’omobani, “Korwa Misiri nkarangeria omwana one.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Herode ogoita abana ba Bethlehemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Herode achia korora ng’a ochaayirwe n’ abaringoria baria b’eching’enang’eni, akaba nekeririanda ekenene mono, agatoma abanto goita abana abaisia bonsi abarenge Bethlehemu ne chinsemo chiaye chionsi, abwo barenge inse y’emiaka ebere, koreng’ana n’ekero keria atebetigwe n’abanto baria abang’aini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ekio rigaikerana eriatebetwe nomobani Yeremia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eriogi riaigurwe Rama, okorera na okweumia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Raeli nkoreera are abana baye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "tancheti akirigwe, ekiagera bonsi bakuure.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okoiranigwa kw’Omwana korwa Misiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega Herode gakuure, omomalaika bw’Omonene akamoorokera Yusufu aria Misiri ase chindoto, akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Imoka, oire omwana na ng’ina, mogende ase ense ya Israeli, ekiagera baria barenge korigia obogima bw’omwana bakuure.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaimoka, akaira omwana amo na ng’ina, akagenda ase ense ya Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende agachia koigwa ng’a Arikelau obekirwe oborwoti Boyahudi ase ribaga ria Herode ise, akairoka kogenda aroro, korende erio gakuureirwe na Nyasae ase okorota, akagenda ensemo ya Galili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akagenda, akamenya omochie oyomo okorokwa Nazareti, rinyare goikerana eriatebetwe nababani, “Igo ararokwe Omonazareti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
